WEBVTT

00:02:57.076 --> 00:03:01.236
Now, to keep 1.5-degree limits alive,

00:03:01.276 --> 00:03:04.716
we’ve got to halve
global emissions by 2030.

00:03:05.276 --> 00:03:07.276
That’s right, halve.

00:03:07.396 --> 00:03:10.196
That is a huge undertaking.

00:03:11.116 --> 00:03:15.196
But, you know, I’m hopeful
because climate is now mainstream

00:03:15.236 --> 00:03:17.716
and that is turning
the global economy green.

00:03:18.116 --> 00:03:20.076
Increasingly, the Swampies of the world,

00:03:20.116 --> 00:03:22.196
they’re not protesting
in trees and tunnels,

00:03:22.196 --> 00:03:25.636
they’re all around us in the boardrooms
as well as the classrooms.

00:03:25.716 --> 00:03:28.156
In government departments
and on trading floors

00:03:28.196 --> 00:03:29.996
all around the world.